# Secrets and local settings never go into an image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.crt

# Built and installed files: each image makes its own.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/logs
**/*.log
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.hf

# Not needed to build or run Ink.
.git
.github
docs
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.playwright
PRODUCT.md
